:"description","html":"\n                <h2>WGP Mini UPS 10400mAh Battery Backup (5V/9V/12V) – Updated Version for WiFi Routers, Modems, CCTV, and More</h2><p>Ensure uninterrupted power with the WGP Mini UPS 10400mAh, the perfect backup power solution for WiFi routers, modems, CCTV cameras, and other low-power devices. This updated version features a high-capacity lithium battery and supports multi-voltage output (5V, 9V, 12V), making it compatible with a wide range of electronics. Whether you're working from home or managing a surveillance system, this portable mini UPS keeps your devices running during power outages.</p><p>With intelligent voltage regulation, automatic power switching, and built-in protection against overcharge, over-discharge, and short circuits, the WGP Mini UPS offers safe and reliable performance. Its compact design makes it easy to install in any home or office setup.</p><h3>Key Benefits:</h3><ul><li>10400mAh Lithium Battery – Long-lasting backup power</li><li>Multi-Voltage Support (5V/9V/12V) – Compatible with routers, cameras, and more</li><li>Automatic Power Switching – Seamless transition during power cuts</li><li>Safety Features – Overload, short-circuit, and overcharge protection</li><li>Compact &amp; Portable – Ideal for both home and business use</li></ul><h3>Perfect for:</h3><p>WiFi Routers | ONT Modems | CCTV Cameras | VoIP Phones | IoT Devices</p><p><br></p><p>Stay online. Stay protected. Stay powered. Choose the WGP Mini UPS 10400mAh for reliable and uninterrupted performance.</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Marsriva KP4 10000mAh – Mini Smart DC UPS","href":"/marsriva-kp4-10000mah--mini-smart-dc-ups","now":"2,190৳","old":"2,400৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsriva KP3 EC 8400mAh – Mini Smart DC UPS","href":"/marsriva-kp3-ec-8400mah-%E2%80%93-mini-smart-dc-ups","now":"2,200৳","old":"2,300৳","single"